 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-- **Precision:** Floating-point precision may affect distance calculations, especially for voxels very close to the surface.
-- **Boundaries:** Voxels far from the isosurface may have large initial upper bounds, reducing pruning efficiency.
